<title>USA: Philadelphia oversight board cancels Jan meeting.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia oversight board cancels Jan meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pennsylvania Intergovernmental Cooperation Authority, Philadelphia's oversight board, said Wednesday it cancelled its Jan 21 meeting.</p>
<p>The next regularly scheduled meeting of the board will be held on Tuesday, Feb. 18 at 1000 EST, PICA said.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
